    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Charming Three-Bedroom Mid-Terraced House with Excellent Potential\r\n\r\nSituated on the outskirts of the popular town of Miltown Malbay on the west coast of County Clare, this modest two-storey mid-terraced residence presents an excellent opportunity for those seeking a property with scope for modernisation and improvement.\r\n\r\nMiltown Malbay is a vibrant west Clare town with a good range of local shops, services, schools, cafés, pubs and amenities, while the surrounding area is renowned for its beautiful coastline, beaches and scenic countryside. The property is also well positioned for access to the wider west Clare region.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation is well laid out and currently comprises an entrance hall, kitchen and sitting room on the ground floor, with the first floor providing three bedrooms and a shower room.\r\n\r\nWhile the property would benefit from modernising and upgrading, it offers considerable potential for a purchaser to transform and finish the home to their own taste and requirements. Externally, the property benefits from a reasonable-sized rear garden area, providing useful outdoor space and further scope for landscaping.\r\n\r\nThis property is ideally suited to a first-time buyer, investor or purchaser looking for an affordable home with potential to add value through modernisation."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall: (2.1 x 7.1) Concrete floor\r\nKitchen: (2.3 x 2.8) Vinyl floor, shelving, sink and base units\r\nLiving Room: (3.09 x 4.0) Vinyl floor, stove\r\nBedroom 1: (2.8 x 2.4) Timber floor, fireplace\r\nBedroom 2: (3.0 x 4.0) Timber floor, fireplace\r\nBedroom 3: (3.0 x 4.0) Timber floor, fireplace\r\nToilet: (2.4 x 1.9) Timber floor, wc, whb\r\nHotpress: Shelving"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tBeautiful quaint townhouse only a few minutes’ walk from Miltown Malbay town\r\n•\tOnly a short distance to beaches at Spanish Point & Lahinch\r\n•\tRenovated in recent years and in excellent condition\r\n•\tSpacious back garden area to the rear\r\n•\tBroadband available in the area\r\n•\tBER E1 339.66 kWh/m2/yr No: 116017930"
      },
